RDS Proxy Application-User Secret — What We Want & What We Found
What we want

Immediate: Add the RDS Proxy application-user secret for the prod environment so prod can authenticate as a dedicated app user instead of the Aurora master user.

Long-term: Move secret creation into modules/aurora-postgres so Terraform creates and owns the secret per environment, with deterministic naming that enables wildcard IAM reads for the Lambda — eliminating manual per-account secret creation and plaintext credential handoffs.

Complication: Two methods currently exist in parallel — (A) reference an externally created secret via ARN, used by dev today; (B) module-creates-the-secret, the target state. Prod needs to land on one of them.

