Known risks for a prod apply
prod.tfvars sets neither aurora_security_group_description nor rds_proxy_security_group_description → both default null. Description is ForceNew on aws_security_group; a mismatch destroys and recreates SGs attached to the live cluster and proxy. Dev and perf both pin theirs with warning comments. Not yet verified against live.
prod.tfvars line 1 still reads # EXAMPLE placeholder values - replace with real prod account/VPC/subnet IDs for your app.
storage_encrypted — verified safe, live and default both false.
